      "writtenOn": "2024-02-28T22:37:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It seems like `Test.AndroidMkEntries()` just writes `data` to `LOCAL_COMPATIBILITY_SUPPORT_FILES`. Given that we already have this information in `provider`, can we utilize this information instead of calling the base module\u0027s \n`AndroidMkEntries()`?\n\nWe could utilize [`androidMkWriteTestData()`](https://source.corp.google.com/h/googleplex-android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:build/soong/java/androidmk.go;drc\u003d7dacb0e872d8a2662e0665f999216badb62e9fc1;l\u003d725) but that may require [exporting](https://go.dev/ref/spec#Exported_identifiers) this method and moving this method to `tradefed` or `android` package in order to prevent import cycles.",
      "revId": "7ac966ede184f977c9e882b831cdc9c9b7bdb611",
